OL,3,GNEWSAZack Polanksi seeks to stand for
OL,4,Aby-election in former PM Starmer's seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FGreen Party leader Zack Polanski has
OL,7,Fconfirmed he wants to stand in the
OL,8,Fby-election brought about by Sir Keir
OL,9,FStarmer's resignation as an MP.
OL,11,FPolanski, who is currently a London
OL,12,FAssembly member but not a member of
OL,13,FParliament, said he was "so excited by
OL,14,Fthe prospect" of being the first Green
OL,15,FMP of Holborn and St Pancras.
OL,17,FThe Greens are targeting the seat,
OL,18,Funtil now a Labour stronghold, after
OL,19,Fcoming second to Labour in the area in
OL,20,Flocal elections earlier this year.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
