OL,3,GNEWSAZack Polanksi seeks to stand for
OL,4,Aby-election in former PM Starmer's seat
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Keir made the announcement on
OL,7,FTuesday that he was quitting as MP for
OL,8,Fthe London constituency, two months
OL,9,Fafter he stood down as prime minister,
OL,10,Fsetting up a challenging by-election
OL,11,Ffor his successor Andy Burnham.
OL,23,APub: 03-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
